00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:27,780
And that's not the only problem we've got.

518
00:34:30,240 --> 00:34:32,769
There are no more guards
to get in our way.

519
00:34:32,900 --> 00:34:35,135
All that's left now is the front door.

520
00:34:39,580 --> 00:34:40,540
All right.

521
00:34:40,840 --> 00:34:42,546
Ready your weapons, everyone.

522
00:34:42,800 --> 00:34:44,600
It's time to open this door.

523
00:34:48,700 --> 00:34:49,780
Get ready.

524
00:34:50,820 --> 00:34:51,940
And push.

525
00:34:55,060 --> 00:34:57,920
I've finally got to get
to go home. Shut up.

526
00:34:58,220 --> 00:35:00,277
We're not done yet, so don't jinx it.

527
00:35:00,360 --> 00:35:03,097
There's one last giant hurdle
waiting for us out there.

528
00:35:03,180 --> 00:35:06,120
A whole Navy fleet, so
we got a ways to go.

529
00:35:14,460 --> 00:35:15,460
It's sunlight.

530
00:35:15,980 --> 00:35:17,680
I can chase the freedom.

531
00:35:17,900 --> 00:35:19,777
Get ready for the fight of your lives.

532
00:35:19,860 --> 00:35:22,757
I don't care how many thousands
of Marines are waiting for us.

533
00:35:22,840 --> 00:35:25,958
We're going to push right
through it, out to the sea!

534
00:35:31,940 --> 00:35:33,420
It's now or never!

535
00:35:33,840 --> 00:35:35,300
Let's go, boys!

536
00:35:37,340 --> 00:35:39,020
Follow me to freedom!

537
00:35:52,840 --> 00:35:53,670
What the hell?

538
00:35:53,820 --> 00:35:56,340
Is this some kind of sick joke?

539
00:35:56,680 --> 00:35:59,040
There's not a single-lady ship in sight!

540
00:36:03,100 --> 00:36:06,512
But weren't we gonna steal one
of their ships to get away?

541
00:36:06,700 --> 00:36:09,460
There's no guards, not even one Marine!

542
00:36:10,100 --> 00:36:13,300
We're just as trapped as we always were!

543
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:19,360
It's not fair, what do we do?

544
00:36:20,580 --> 00:36:23,617
The only option left is
to just wait here and

545
00:36:23,700 --> 00:36:26,517
hope that Magellan kills
us mercifully and quickly.

546
00:36:26,600 --> 00:36:27,430
Damn it!

547
00:36:27,513 --> 00:36:28,912
This can't be happening!

548
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:32,117
They got us.

549
00:36:32,200 --> 00:36:35,637
Gotta give them credit for not being
as stupid as I thought they were.

550
00:36:35,720 --> 00:36:38,838
The water around here is
filled with giant sea kings.

551
00:36:39,060 --> 00:36:44,160
As the saying goes, the Calm Belt is the
greatest barrier protecting Impel Down.

552
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:46,977
We clawed our way out
of the depths of hell

553
00:36:47,060 --> 00:36:50,100
with our merry fingernails
just for this! Damn it!

554
00:36:50,240 --> 00:36:53,437
Now we're gonna get dragged right
back into the flames and be tortured!

555
00:36:53,520 --> 00:36:55,755
We don't have time to sit here moping!

556
00:36:56,260 --> 00:37:00,848
Yes, the Navy's gone, but they only
cleared out because Magellan told them to.

557
00:37:01,140 --> 00:37:02,360
And they're not far!

558
00:37:03,240 --> 00:37:06,769
Look, and you can see the shadows
of their sails on the fog!

559
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:08,750
He's right!

560
00:37:09,580 --> 00:37:11,345
But they're still too far off!

561
00:37:11,440 --> 00:37:13,517
There's no way we've got
a chance of catching them!

562
00:37:13,600 --> 00:37:14,920
It's never too late!

563
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,940
You've got me here, right?

564
00:37:19,280 --> 00:37:21,520
So stand back and let me handle this.

565
00:37:24,360 --> 00:37:25,440
Holy crap.

566
00:37:25,940 --> 00:37:27,600
How freaking strong is he?

567
00:37:27,740 --> 00:37:28,717
You want to keep moving?

568
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:29,630
Hop on.

569
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:36,400
Now, let's do this.

570
00:37:37,020 --> 00:37:37,980
You ready?

571
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:39,200
Here we go.

572
00:37:45,040 --> 00:37:48,197
He's swimming like a shark
with that thing when he's back!

573
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:51,280
Now that's the true captain
of the Fishman Pirates!

574
00:37:52,420 --> 00:37:54,800
Oh man, this is gonna be crazy!

575
00:37:55,080 --> 00:37:57,457
I can't wait to see how
the Warlord's gonna fight!

576
00:37:57,540 --> 00:38:00,893
Not to mention our savior
Captain Buggy right beside him!

577
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:03,588
I can't help but feel
a little hopeful here!

578
00:38:09,260 --> 00:38:10,657
How stupid are they?

579
00:38:10,740 --> 00:38:13,057
It's a hell of a lot safer
to stick with a warlord

580
00:38:13,140 --> 00:38:15,877
than stay behind and try to
face Magellan on your own,

581
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:16,790
idiots!

582
00:38:20,100 --> 00:38:21,100
They're shooting!

583
00:38:24,020 --> 00:38:25,800
Seems like they smarted us.

584
00:38:26,300 --> 00:38:27,400
He dodged it!

585
00:38:27,520 --> 00:38:28,360
He's too fast!

586
00:38:28,640 --> 00:38:31,897
That's not just a fish man, that's
the first son of the sea, Jinbei!

587
00:38:31,980 --> 00:38:34,280
All forces, open fire!

588
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:38,348
As long as we can sing Jinbei,
the rest of them are finished.

589
00:38:39,080 --> 00:38:40,160
Here they are!

590
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:41,791
An entire fleet of ships!

591
00:38:48,540 --> 00:38:52,840
I'm gonna launch you guys on the
deck, so hold on tight now! Huh?

592
00:38:53,060 --> 00:38:54,097
Wait, you're what?

593
00:38:54,180 --> 00:38:57,557
You maybe wanna run that plan
past us one more time, fish face?

594
00:38:57,640 --> 00:38:58,470
What the...

595
00:38:58,553 --> 00:38:59,940
the bastard's gone!

596
00:39:00,140 --> 00:39:01,820
What the hell's going on?

597
00:39:02,780 --> 00:39:03,620
I see.

598
00:39:03,780 --> 00:39:06,797
He left us here his bait
and scram off on his own!

599
00:39:06,880 --> 00:39:09,060
Traitor, traitor, traitor, traitor,

600
00:39:10,333 --> 00:39:11,880
Why the hell did you come with us?

601
00:39:13,040 --> 00:39:13,870
Jinbae!

602
00:39:13,953 --> 00:39:15,517
How could you leave us like this?

603
00:39:15,600 --> 00:39:17,300
We're sending cops out here.

604
00:39:19,940 --> 00:39:21,580
Fishman Jiu-Jitsu!

605
00:39:27,640 --> 00:39:28,470
Warheart!

606
00:39:35,160 --> 00:39:37,540
It's coming straight forward!

607
00:39:43,980 --> 00:39:47,860
Ocean current, shoulder throw!

608
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:01,040
We're flying!

609
00:40:03,860 --> 00:40:05,597
What's with that water column?

610
00:40:05,680 --> 00:40:07,327
It's moving like it's alive!

611
00:40:07,520 --> 00:40:09,814
Do you have any idea what's causing it?

612
00:40:10,220 --> 00:40:13,580
Not the foggiest, but I
can see people on the tip.

613
00:40:14,060 --> 00:40:15,472
One of them's crocodile!

614
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:31,197
They're going to try to hijack the ship.

615
00:40:31,280 --> 00:40:32,110
Stop them!

616
00:40:32,193 --> 00:40:33,577
Attack them with everything you've got!

617
00:40:33,660 --> 00:40:35,597
They've got Devil Fruit powers!

618
00:40:35,680 --> 00:40:37,386
Just throw them in the water!
